<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"> 
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Luqmafresh OTP</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4;">
 
  <div style="margin: 50px auto; width: 50%; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dgghwthdr/image/upload/v1706462404/bhk0qcehbjamxnaaymvs.png" alt="Luqmafresh Logo" style="max-width: 150px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.6em; color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px;">Hi there!</p>

      <p style="font-size: 1.4em; color: #333;">Thank you for choosing Luqmafresh.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1.4em; color: #333;">Your One Time Password (OTP) to complete your procedures:</p>

      <h2 style="background: #f72d55; margin: 20px auto; width: max-content; padding: 10px 20px; color: #fff; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; font-size: 1.8em;">#{otp}</h2>

      <p style="font-size: 1.4em; color: #333;">This OTP is valid for the next 5 minutes.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1.4em; color: #333;">If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.6em; color: #f72d55;">Best Regards,<br />Luqmafresh Team</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 20px;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dgghwthdr/image/upload/v1706462408/quxz0mewku1ztsokfwqy.png" alt="Footer Image" style="max-width: 100%;">
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
